config FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ_DENON
	bool "Domoticz plugin: Denon/Marantz AV receiver"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_DOMOTICZ
	default n
	help
		control Denon and Marantz AV receivers over the LAN

		It is a Python plugin of Domoticz: the package installs it into
		/usr/share/domoticz/plugins/Domoticz-Denon-Plugin, the directory Domoticz is
		started with (-approot of the domoticz package), and it needs no
		change of the Domoticz build.

		The plugin imports the Domoticz module and the Python standard
		library only, so no additional Python package is required.

		Setup: Setup -> Hardware -> Denon/Marantz, enter the address of the receiver.

		Licensed upstream (LICENSE is installed with the plugin). The
		repository has no release tags, so the build fetches a pinned commit of
		the default branch.
